# Our flag names must never ship in the published SDK. The SDK must not
# vend a concrete `Flag` enum: it would leak dogfood flag names AND collide
# with the customer's own `sheepit codegen` output.
#
# `pnpm codegen:flags` currently emits ONLY TypeScript
# (packages/shared/src/generated/flags.ts) — no Swift target exists today.
# When apps/ios wires one up it generates into its own tree, never here.
Flags.swift
